@@ -470,0 +471,8 @@
+# 0.9.27
+
+- Add an optional private, exact-ID/name reviewed identity layer without changing native metadata.
+- Separate safe association terms and explicit review holds from identity eligibility.
+- Support approved fictional mascot/avatar, collective, shared-mantle and female-form categories.
+- Preserve ignore preferences, duplicate guards, adult-performer verification and additive-only writes.
+- Keep research/decisions private; public packages rebuild without local bindings.
+
